1
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:35,000
(Blossom Through the Cloud)

2
00:01:35,001 --> 00:01:37,960
(Adapted from the novel on JJWXC,
"Landing on My Heart", by Qiao Yao)

3
00:01:44,280 --> 00:01:45,920
Ready to meet in the Otherworld.

4
00:01:47,280 --> 00:01:49,280
Coordinates refreshed.
Explore without fear.

5
00:01:57,560 --> 00:01:59,280
How will we recognize each other?

6
00:02:00,840 --> 00:02:02,640
Let's use our identities
from the game Scorched Earth Era.

7
00:02:10,680 --> 00:02:12,160
Don't drink anything from strangers.

8
00:02:12,440 --> 00:02:14,520
If you leave your seat, don't drink
the water when you return.

9
00:02:15,960 --> 00:02:17,840
Report your location
in the group chat.

10
00:02:17,960 --> 00:02:19,680
Send a message every 30 minutes.

11
00:02:20,720 --> 00:02:21,800
What if I don't?

12
00:02:22,800 --> 00:02:24,120
I'll post a missing person notice.

13
00:02:28,600 --> 00:02:30,600
Help! I'm not a child anymore!

14
00:02:30,960 --> 00:02:32,360
You two are being a bit dramatic.

15
00:02:33,160 --> 00:02:34,920
Would an adult really do this?

16
00:02:35,280 --> 00:02:36,280
Meeting an online friend?

17
00:02:37,320 --> 00:02:38,479
What if you find out...

18
00:02:38,480 --> 00:02:39,840
he's just some little kid?

19
00:02:40,720 --> 00:02:41,720
(Fly to the Top of the Wealthy List)

20
00:02:41,721 --> 00:02:44,240
(Speechless)

21
00:02:44,360 --> 00:02:45,640
That's impossible!

22
00:02:59,640 --> 00:03:00,640
Where is he?

23
00:03:01,320 --> 00:03:02,680
No cosplayers either.

24
00:03:12,360 --> 00:03:14,360
Is he really just a kid?

25
00:03:28,320 --> 00:03:29,320
What are you laughing at?

26
00:03:29,720 --> 00:03:30,800
Are you Commander Zhen?

27
00:03:31,280 --> 00:03:32,360
Don't tell me you're...

28
00:03:32,960 --> 00:03:34,279
Deer Call?

29
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:36,280
You must be
at least 12 years old to play.

30
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:38,200
I'm only eight.

31
00:03:39,200 --> 00:03:40,320
Do I look that old?

32
00:03:40,600 --> 00:03:41,600
Then you're...

33
00:03:44,200 --> 00:03:45,440
Isn't it obvious?

34
00:03:46,120 --> 00:03:47,480
The Explorer.

35
00:03:48,120 --> 00:03:49,880
I'm Pao Meng, your Otherworld guide.

36
00:03:50,320 --> 00:03:51,400
Your best partner.

37
00:03:55,240 --> 00:03:56,240
Follow me.

38
00:03:58,920 --> 00:04:00,280
Adults are so boring.

39
00:04:04,280 --> 00:04:05,280
- Hello.
- Hello.

40
00:04:10,600 --> 00:04:11,600
Hi.

41
00:04:11,720 --> 00:04:12,880
- Hello there.
- Hello.

42
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:16,640
- This is for you.
- Thank you, miss.

43
00:04:22,840 --> 00:04:23,960
- Hello.
- Hello.

44
00:04:25,200 --> 00:04:26,200
You two.

45
00:04:36,880 --> 00:04:37,880
A pleasure to meet you.

46
00:04:47,600 --> 00:04:49,600
I've heard the rumors
of you two in Mang City.

47
00:04:57,320 --> 00:04:58,320
This way, please.

48
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:08,200
(Episode 7: Is Love Contagious?)

49
00:05:19,640 --> 00:05:20,640
Hello, Mr. Zeng.

50
00:05:20,840 --> 00:05:22,200
The photoshoot is
at the training center.

51
00:05:23,040 --> 00:05:24,040
We've already arrived.

52
00:05:25,840 --> 00:05:26,840
At the training center?

53
00:05:27,080 --> 00:05:28,680
Yes. See you later.

54
00:05:30,200 --> 00:05:31,440
Okay, I'll be right there.

55
00:05:47,880 --> 00:05:48,880
Xiao Ruan,

56
00:05:48,881 --> 00:05:50,800
the entire camera crew is ready.

57
00:05:51,360 --> 00:05:53,240
We won't take up too much
of your training time.

58
00:05:53,680 --> 00:05:54,680
Come on.

59
00:05:55,200 --> 00:05:56,200
We meet again, Ms. Ruan.

60
00:05:56,680 --> 00:05:57,759
I only got the news
about the change...

61
00:05:57,760 --> 00:05:59,120
to the shooting plan
last minute yesterday.

62
00:05:59,640 --> 00:06:00,640
But don't worry.

63
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:03,520
The new plan should be
within your comfort zone.

64
00:06:03,840 --> 00:06:05,759
You just have to train as usual.

65
00:06:05,760 --> 00:06:06,840
Just pretend I'm not here.

66
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:08,480
Our simulator training
models emergency situations.

67
00:06:08,840 --> 00:06:10,040
It might not be
in your comfort zone.

68
00:06:10,640 --> 00:06:12,360
You have your expertise,
and I have mine.

69
00:06:13,160 --> 00:06:14,600
You might not know,

70
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:16,640
but we photographers don't
like staying in our comfort zones.

71
00:06:20,040 --> 00:06:21,640
I'm really sorry about yesterday.

72
00:06:21,800 --> 00:06:23,399
I know you must not like Yan An.

73
00:06:23,400 --> 00:06:24,800
I just wanted to make him give up.

74
00:06:26,160 --> 00:06:27,160
Then I should thank you.

75
00:06:31,200 --> 00:06:33,200
What matters is
that today's shoot goes smoothly.

76
00:06:34,560 --> 00:06:36,560
Right, let me say one more thing.

77
00:06:37,240 --> 00:06:38,360
Regarding today's shooting plan,

78
00:06:38,480 --> 00:06:40,199
Fu Ming Yu completely
respected your wishes...

79
00:06:40,200 --> 00:06:41,480
and your schedule.

80
00:06:42,920 --> 00:06:44,400
How is it? Is the shoot ready?

81
00:06:45,080 --> 00:06:46,080
It's ready.

82
00:06:50,760 --> 00:06:51,760
Captain Fan,

83
00:06:51,800 --> 00:06:52,800
thank you for your hard work.

84
00:06:52,960 --> 00:06:55,440
This shoot won't take up
everyone's break time.

85
00:06:55,760 --> 00:06:58,279
Also, just train as you usually do.

86
00:06:58,280 --> 00:07:00,080
Okay. Then let's get ready to start.

87
00:07:01,120 --> 00:07:02,120
Let's go.

88
00:07:02,920 --> 00:07:04,200
- Let's begin.
- Let's go.

89
00:07:14,040 --> 00:07:15,799
Today's training is terrain warning.

90
00:07:15,800 --> 00:07:17,199
Hengshi 5101.

91
00:07:17,200 --> 00:07:18,400
Descend 12.

92
00:07:18,720 --> 00:07:20,200
Maintain current heading.

93
00:07:22,320 --> 00:07:23,320
Maintain heading.

94
00:07:23,360 --> 00:07:24,360
Descend 12.
Hengshi 5101.

95
00:07:25,840 --> 00:07:26,840
Descend 12.

96
00:07:27,360 --> 00:07:28,360
Confirm.

97
00:07:32,800 --> 00:07:34,320
Altitude 12, 39 set.

98
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:36,000
Confirmed.

99
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:40,319
Thrust idle, open descent, alt blue.

100
00:07:40,320 --> 00:07:41,320
Altitude 12, 39 blue.

101
00:07:42,040 --> 00:07:43,040
Check.

102
00:07:47,720 --> 00:07:48,720
Maintain heading.

103
00:07:48,800 --> 00:07:50,000
- Confirm.
- Heading.

104
00:07:50,440 --> 00:07:51,440
Check.

105
00:08:03,760 --> 00:08:04,760
Sink rate.

106
00:08:05,320 --> 00:08:06,879
Terrain ahead. Pull up!

107
00:08:06,880 --> 00:08:08,160
- Pull up. TOGA thrust.
- Sink rate.

108
00:08:08,760 --> 00:08:10,239
Terrain ahead. Pull up!

109
00:08:10,240 --> 00:08:11,240
Manual TOGA.

110
00:08:11,560 --> 00:08:12,560
Auto-thrust blue.
Terrain ahead.

111
00:08:16,560 --> 00:08:17,720
Jiangcheng, Hengshi 5101.

112
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:19,000
Terrain warning.
I'm pulling up.

113
00:08:36,800 --> 00:08:37,800
Come here.

114
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:43,440
Let me tell you two something.

115
00:08:44,280 --> 00:08:45,760
Just now, Xiao Ruan,

116
00:08:46,560 --> 00:08:48,479
you must tilt up more slowly.

117
00:08:48,480 --> 00:08:49,800
Tilt it up slowly.

118
00:08:49,840 --> 00:08:51,080
Tilt it up bit by bit.

119
00:09:18,600 --> 00:09:20,000
Slowly, you two.

120
00:09:20,080 --> 00:09:21,080
Watch your speed.

121
00:09:21,360 --> 00:09:22,360
Let's go.

122
00:09:59,080 --> 00:10:00,080
(Zheng You An)

123
00:10:20,040 --> 00:10:21,400
Today's shoot went very well.

124
00:10:21,720 --> 00:10:22,720
Good job.

125
00:10:22,721 --> 00:10:24,800
(Yan An)

126
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:31,240
- Hello?
- Ms. Ruan.

127
00:10:31,560 --> 00:10:32,560
Go to the window.

128
00:10:36,800 --> 00:10:37,800
Wait a second.

129
00:10:40,040 --> 00:10:41,040
Mr. Fu.

130
00:10:41,960 --> 00:10:42,960
Are you on the phone?

131
00:10:43,080 --> 00:10:44,080
I'll come back in a bit.

132
00:10:44,200 --> 00:10:45,200
Okay.

133
00:10:47,800 --> 00:10:49,160
Hello? What's up?

134
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:50,800
Are you at the window yet?

135
00:10:51,880 --> 00:10:52,880
The window?

136
00:10:53,480 --> 00:10:54,480
Which window?

137
00:10:54,720 --> 00:10:56,200
The kitchen window!

138
00:10:57,200 --> 00:10:58,200
The kitchen?

139
00:10:59,400 --> 00:11:00,400
I'm here. Go ahead.

140
00:11:01,040 --> 00:11:03,880
Tonight, I will bloom for you
one last time!

141
00:11:22,600 --> 00:11:23,600
Si Xian!

142
00:11:24,360 --> 00:11:25,360
Do you see it?

143
00:11:25,760 --> 00:11:27,000
Isn't it breathtaking?

144
00:11:27,360 --> 00:11:28,360
What?

145
00:11:29,360 --> 00:11:30,719
- This is my...
- What did you say?

146
00:11:30,720 --> 00:11:32,440
The fireworks I set off for you!

147
00:11:32,760 --> 00:11:34,760
Hello?

148
00:11:43,880 --> 00:11:44,880
This is so embarrassing.

149
00:11:47,160 --> 00:11:48,160
Who is it?
Did you set off the fireworks?

150
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:51,160
No, I didn't. What?

151
00:11:53,640 --> 00:11:54,919
Fu Ming Yu, you're such a jerk!

152
00:11:54,920 --> 00:11:56,600
Stop right there! Don't run!

153
00:11:57,320 --> 00:11:58,320
Stop!

154
00:11:59,240 --> 00:12:00,240
- Are you crazy?
- Don't run!

155
00:12:00,241 --> 00:12:01,280
- Go over there and cut him off!
- Okay!

156
00:12:10,880 --> 00:12:11,880
Stop!

157
00:12:12,000 --> 00:12:13,200
It really wasn't me!

158
00:12:13,520 --> 00:12:14,520
- Stop!
- Don't run!

159
00:12:15,760 --> 00:12:16,760
Stop!

160
00:12:20,480 --> 00:12:21,480
You're a real jerk!

161
00:12:23,200 --> 00:12:24,200
Don't run!

162
00:12:26,680 --> 00:12:27,680
Stop!

163
00:12:30,680 --> 00:12:31,680
Grab him!

164
00:12:32,160 --> 00:12:33,440
Don't pull me!

165
00:12:33,520 --> 00:12:34,920
- I've got him!
- Let me go!

166
00:12:36,240 --> 00:12:37,240
Fu Ming Yu, you jerk!

167
00:12:38,440 --> 00:12:40,160
I'll stop!

168
00:12:44,360 --> 00:12:45,360
Sir.

169
00:12:47,160 --> 00:12:48,160
Tonight,

170
00:12:49,000 --> 00:12:51,000
I did all this for the residents
of this neighborhood.

171
00:12:51,080 --> 00:12:52,120
I was just trying
to do something nice.

172
00:12:52,840 --> 00:12:53,840
My good intentions went wrong.

173
00:12:54,320 --> 00:12:55,320
I'll never set them off again.

174
00:12:55,600 --> 00:12:56,600
Never again.

175
00:12:57,000 --> 00:12:58,000
Get out of here.
Don't let me see you again.

176
00:12:59,760 --> 00:13:00,760
Clean this up quickly.

177
00:13:00,800 --> 00:13:02,000
- Don't cause a fire hazard.
- Okay.

178
00:13:02,680 --> 00:13:03,800
Sorry for the trouble.

179
00:13:04,320 --> 00:13:05,320
My apologies.

180
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:08,480
I must say, you're quite photogenic.

181
00:13:09,480 --> 00:13:11,360
Fu Ming Yu, you're a real jerk!

182
00:13:11,800 --> 00:13:12,840
That heroic feat of yours...

183
00:13:13,440 --> 00:13:14,440
has been sent to our group chat.

184
00:13:14,880 --> 00:13:16,520
And stop trying to show off.

185
00:13:17,360 --> 00:13:19,840
This trick might have worked
on your exes,

186
00:13:19,920 --> 00:13:20,960
but it definitely won't work...

187
00:13:21,400 --> 00:13:22,400
on Ruan Si Xian.

188
00:13:28,080 --> 00:13:29,120
I'm showing off?

189
00:13:30,640 --> 00:13:31,640
Fu Ming Yu, let me ask you.

190
00:13:31,800 --> 00:13:32,960
If you like Ruan Si Xian,

191
00:13:34,480 --> 00:13:36,040
why don't you pursue her openly?

192
00:13:37,680 --> 00:13:38,680
What are you afraid of?

193
00:13:40,240 --> 00:13:41,240
Are you afraid she'll reject you?

194
00:13:42,280 --> 00:13:43,280
Or are you afraid of losing?

195
00:13:47,760 --> 00:13:48,760
Yes.

196
00:13:50,120 --> 00:13:52,320
After tonight, I probably
have no chance at all.

197
00:13:53,000 --> 00:13:54,000
But I think I'm better than you.

198
00:13:55,440 --> 00:13:56,440
At least I've...

199
00:14:00,080 --> 00:14:01,080
had my moment.

200
00:14:31,840 --> 00:14:33,920
I just happened to mention to him...

201
00:14:34,280 --> 00:14:36,280
that my friends were worried
about me meeting a stranger,

202
00:14:36,760 --> 00:14:39,279
so he called over
all those cosplayers.

203
00:14:39,280 --> 00:14:40,480
He gave me a huge surprise.

204
00:14:41,480 --> 00:14:42,480
Anyway,

205
00:14:42,760 --> 00:14:44,320
I can tell from this...

206
00:14:44,600 --> 00:14:47,160
that he's a thoughtful
and attentive person.

207
00:14:48,000 --> 00:14:49,000
Anyway,

208
00:14:49,400 --> 00:14:50,560
it's like a dream.

209
00:14:50,960 --> 00:14:51,960
Your hands are wet.

210
00:14:54,320 --> 00:14:55,560
You think it's like a dream too?

211
00:14:56,200 --> 00:14:58,920
How can such a perfect man
exist in this world?

212
00:14:59,720 --> 00:15:00,720
He fits all your criteria.

213
00:15:01,280 --> 00:15:02,280
What does that mean?

214
00:15:02,320 --> 00:15:04,479
It means I've been
living a balanced life...

215
00:15:04,480 --> 00:15:05,800
and doing good deeds
for so many years,

216
00:15:06,200 --> 00:15:07,320
and I finally opened a blind box...

217
00:15:07,520 --> 00:15:08,680
and got the hidden limited edition.

218
00:15:09,720 --> 00:15:10,720
Wake up.

219
00:15:11,040 --> 00:15:13,040
It just means he's making
concessions to accommodate you.

220
00:15:16,800 --> 00:15:17,800
What?

221
00:15:18,160 --> 00:15:19,160
Ruan Ruan,

222
00:15:19,560 --> 00:15:20,920
you're just too clear-headed.

223
00:15:21,320 --> 00:15:23,479
Do you know that Athena,
the goddess of wisdom,

224
00:15:23,480 --> 00:15:25,479
and Venus didn't get along?

225
00:15:25,480 --> 00:15:26,920
So as the son of Venus,

226
00:15:27,320 --> 00:15:28,439
Cupid, the god of love,

227
00:15:28,440 --> 00:15:30,960
won't favor a woman as smart as you.

228
00:15:31,120 --> 00:15:33,240
Where did you hear
this unofficial history?

229
00:15:33,880 --> 00:15:34,880
Just take me as an example.

230
00:15:35,200 --> 00:15:36,200
I used to think...

231
00:15:36,201 --> 00:15:38,079
it was hard to meet someone
who's truly compatible with me.

232
00:15:38,080 --> 00:15:39,320
But through this,

233
00:15:39,960 --> 00:15:41,199
I realized that in this world,

234
00:15:41,200 --> 00:15:42,240
soulmates really do exist.

235
00:15:42,680 --> 00:15:43,919
It's just that
our life trajectories...

236
00:15:43,920 --> 00:15:45,160
limited our chances of meeting.

237
00:15:45,360 --> 00:15:47,480
So we need big data...

238
00:15:47,560 --> 00:15:48,960
to bring him to us.

239
00:15:49,800 --> 00:15:51,040
Relying on big data for love?

240
00:15:51,720 --> 00:15:53,720
That's unreliable.
Totally unreliable.

241
00:15:53,840 --> 00:15:55,319
You know what people are best at...

242
00:15:55,320 --> 00:15:56,320
is beautifying themselves...

243
00:15:56,440 --> 00:15:57,440
on the internet.

244
00:15:57,640 --> 00:15:59,159
Maybe in real life,

245
00:15:59,160 --> 00:16:00,160
he might be...

246
00:16:00,440 --> 00:16:01,640
a decent person.

247
00:16:01,880 --> 00:16:04,640
His hobbies might even
be the same as yours.

248
00:16:04,960 --> 00:16:06,320
But in a relationship,

249
00:16:06,760 --> 00:16:07,920
he might not be a good guy.

250
00:16:08,280 --> 00:16:10,279
No. Just remember.

251
00:16:10,280 --> 00:16:13,440
Good men don't show up in big data.

252
00:16:14,440 --> 00:16:15,440
I disagree.

253
00:16:15,680 --> 00:16:17,880
It's possible for a good man
to be waiting for the right person.

254
00:16:18,280 --> 00:16:19,879
Why are you everywhere?

255
00:16:19,880 --> 00:16:21,000
Get lost.

256
00:16:22,000 --> 00:16:24,160
Ignore him.
Just remember what I said.

257
00:16:24,560 --> 00:16:26,560
Don't let him
scam you out of everything.

258
00:16:27,560 --> 00:16:28,640
What's there to scam me out of?

259
00:16:29,000 --> 00:16:30,480
Forget it. I won't
explain it to you two.

260
00:16:31,040 --> 00:16:32,400
I'll bring them over another day...

261
00:16:32,520 --> 00:16:33,520
to meet you.

262
00:16:34,560 --> 00:16:35,560
- Them?
- Them?

263
00:16:36,280 --> 00:16:37,280
Him!

264
00:16:37,680 --> 00:16:38,999
A slip of the tongue.

265
00:16:39,000 --> 00:16:40,519
You got my hopes up for nothing.

266
00:16:40,520 --> 00:16:41,520
Rag!

267
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:53,000
Oh my gosh.

268
00:16:55,720 --> 00:16:56,720
What do you think?

269
00:16:56,840 --> 00:16:57,840
Are you satisfied with this one?

270
00:16:58,280 --> 00:16:59,320
If not,

271
00:17:00,520 --> 00:17:01,520
we can look at more this afternoon.
I really can't walk anymore.

272
00:17:05,680 --> 00:17:07,160
Just give me a straight answer.

273
00:17:08,440 --> 00:17:10,319
If not, let's go eat.

274
00:17:10,320 --> 00:17:11,560
We'll see the rest tomorrow.

275
00:17:13,760 --> 00:17:14,840
Can you keep it down?

276
00:17:15,440 --> 00:17:16,520
If the agent hears you,

277
00:17:16,880 --> 00:17:17,960
how can I negotiate?

278
00:17:18,240 --> 00:17:20,120
My gosh, what's there to negotiate?

279
00:17:20,360 --> 00:17:21,760
Buddy, we'll take this one.

280
00:17:22,680 --> 00:17:23,960
Who said we're taking it?

281
00:17:24,800 --> 00:17:26,920
I still have a few questions to ask.

282
00:17:27,480 --> 00:17:28,480
Don't listen to her.

283
00:17:28,640 --> 00:17:29,640
She just wants to bargain with you.

284
00:17:29,840 --> 00:17:31,960
Miss, we really can't
lower the price here.

285
00:17:32,760 --> 00:17:33,760
That's enough.

286
00:17:36,200 --> 00:17:37,240
The two of us...

287
00:17:37,800 --> 00:17:39,359
have been with you all day.

288
00:17:39,360 --> 00:17:40,920
We've seen all kinds of places.

289
00:17:41,240 --> 00:17:42,240
Don't make it hard for him.

290
00:17:42,520 --> 00:17:43,759
Just let me
spend a little more money...

291
00:17:43,760 --> 00:17:45,439
to make myself feel better, okay?

292
00:17:45,440 --> 00:17:46,880
I'm recovering from heartbreak.

293
00:17:47,120 --> 00:17:48,200
I just want to spend money.

294
00:17:48,320 --> 00:17:49,640
- I'm begging you.
- Stop it.

295
00:17:50,600 --> 00:17:51,880
I'm not making it hard for you,

296
00:17:52,880 --> 00:17:54,320
so don't make it hard for me either.

297
00:17:55,640 --> 00:17:57,040
Our family's current situation...

298
00:18:01,080 --> 00:18:02,080
It's none of your business anyway.

299
00:18:05,080 --> 00:18:06,080
It's fine.

300
00:18:06,640 --> 00:18:07,879
I know that...

301
00:18:07,880 --> 00:18:09,480
funds are tight in the early stages
of your business.

302
00:18:09,760 --> 00:18:11,000
But consider the rent
for this place...

303
00:18:11,240 --> 00:18:12,920
my initial investment.

304
00:18:13,760 --> 00:18:15,760
I really have high hopes for you.

305
00:18:23,520 --> 00:18:24,520
Ms. Zheng.

306
00:18:24,840 --> 00:18:26,320
Most importantly,

307
00:18:28,040 --> 00:18:29,240
I think this place...

308
00:18:30,160 --> 00:18:31,360
matches your aura...

309
00:18:32,040 --> 00:18:33,160
perfectly.

310
00:18:34,480 --> 00:18:35,480
How so?

311
00:18:38,520 --> 00:18:39,960
First, look at this space.

312
00:18:40,400 --> 00:18:41,400
It's perfect for you...

313
00:18:41,800 --> 00:18:42,800
to use as a studio.

314
00:18:43,080 --> 00:18:44,080
Secondly,

315
00:18:44,760 --> 00:18:45,760
look at the windows on this side.

316
00:18:50,120 --> 00:18:51,120
What's planted outside?

317
00:18:52,320 --> 00:18:53,720
Bamboo. Chinese style.

318
00:18:54,160 --> 00:18:55,320
What does Chinese style represent?

319
00:18:55,520 --> 00:18:56,720
It represents your background,

320
00:18:57,520 --> 00:18:58,800
your nationality,

321
00:18:59,640 --> 00:19:00,640
and it represents...

322
00:19:01,080 --> 00:19:02,080
your roots.

323
00:19:03,280 --> 00:19:05,120
Now, turn around and look back.

324
00:19:05,760 --> 00:19:07,640
The silver crystal chandelier
above you...

325
00:19:07,880 --> 00:19:08,880
is European style.

326
00:19:09,040 --> 00:19:10,040
What does European style represent?

327
00:19:10,280 --> 00:19:12,280
It represents your experience
studying photography.

328
00:19:12,840 --> 00:19:14,799
It's such a low-key
and subtle representation...

329
00:19:14,800 --> 00:19:16,080
of your background...

330
00:19:16,400 --> 00:19:18,280
and the studios you've worked in.

331
00:19:18,960 --> 00:19:20,720
It's basically custom-made for you.

332
00:19:21,000 --> 00:19:22,000
In all of Jiangcheng,

333
00:19:23,160 --> 00:19:24,160
this is the only one.

334
00:19:24,320 --> 00:19:25,440
Isn't this place great?

335
00:19:25,920 --> 00:19:26,920
It's such a bargain.
Let's sign for it.

336
00:19:28,720 --> 00:19:29,720
No.

337
00:19:30,360 --> 00:19:33,280
I've already lost 30,000 yuan.

338
00:19:33,520 --> 00:19:34,520
It's on me.

339
00:19:34,521 --> 00:19:35,640
I, Yan An,

340
00:19:36,160 --> 00:19:37,680
should pay for my impulsiveness.

341
00:19:38,520 --> 00:19:39,520
Sign it.

342
00:19:40,000 --> 00:19:41,000
I also think...

343
00:20:08,280 --> 00:20:10,160
I thought we would be meeting
at an Internet cafe.

344
00:20:10,920 --> 00:20:12,760
He doesn't expect the three of us...

345
00:20:13,200 --> 00:20:14,320
to be his cheerleaders, does he?

346
00:20:17,640 --> 00:20:19,800
So who's playing the good cop,
and who's playing the bad cop?

347
00:20:20,280 --> 00:20:21,360
I think we should both be good cops.

348
00:20:22,120 --> 00:20:23,680
We need to let him know
that although Xiao Zhen is naive,

349
00:20:24,080 --> 00:20:25,280
her friends aren't pushovers.

350
00:20:27,280 --> 00:20:28,280
They're coming.

351
00:20:30,040 --> 00:20:31,040
You're all here.

352
00:20:35,160 --> 00:20:36,160
Let me introduce you.

353
00:20:36,600 --> 00:20:38,120
This is the pro
who carries me in games,

354
00:20:38,320 --> 00:20:39,320
Lu Ming.

355
00:20:39,400 --> 00:20:40,400
Hello, everyone.

356
00:20:42,400 --> 00:20:43,560
This is Ruan Ruan and Xuan,

357
00:20:43,920 --> 00:20:45,000
my two best friends.

358
00:20:46,520 --> 00:20:48,360
Oh, right. I brought
some water for everyone.

359
00:20:49,640 --> 00:20:50,640
Please help yourselves.

360
00:20:52,160 --> 00:20:53,160
That's very thoughtful.

361
00:20:56,440 --> 00:20:57,560
Shall we go play then?

362
00:20:57,880 --> 00:20:58,920
- Let's go.
- Let's go.

363
00:21:04,920 --> 00:21:05,920
Are you ready?

364
00:21:07,000 --> 00:21:09,000
Give it to me.

365
00:21:09,640 --> 00:21:10,640
Give it to me.

366
00:21:10,880 --> 00:21:11,880
Catch!

367
00:21:13,720 --> 00:21:14,720
Xiao Zhen.

368
00:21:16,920 --> 00:21:17,920
One, two, three.

369
00:21:20,400 --> 00:21:21,480
I don't know how to play.

370
00:21:21,760 --> 00:21:23,079
Use a little less strength.
Let's try it again.

371
00:21:23,080 --> 00:21:24,360
- Okay.
- Come on.

372
00:21:25,600 --> 00:21:26,960
- Are you ready?
- I'm ready.

373
00:21:27,320 --> 00:21:28,760
Why are we standing here?

374
00:21:29,880 --> 00:21:30,880
I don't know.

375
00:21:37,720 --> 00:21:39,159
- Nice shot!
- I'm so good at this.

376
00:21:39,160 --> 00:21:40,400
Just throw it like that. Got it?

377
00:21:41,040 --> 00:21:42,040
Let's try again.

378
00:21:42,720 --> 00:21:43,720
You're so good.

379
00:21:43,721 --> 00:21:44,880
You're a good teacher.

380
00:21:49,200 --> 00:21:50,680
Why are we sitting here?

381
00:21:52,560 --> 00:21:53,679
- Like this.
- It's better than standing.

382
00:21:53,680 --> 00:21:54,680
Yes, use this hand to guard it.

383
00:21:54,681 --> 00:21:55,880
- Like this?
- Yes, guard it.

384
00:21:56,680 --> 00:21:58,680
Come on, try it. One, two, three!

385
00:21:59,440 --> 00:22:00,560
No.

386
00:22:00,640 --> 00:22:01,959
No, not like that. Not like that.

387
00:22:01,960 --> 00:22:05,239
Xiao Zhen must have done
so many good deeds.

388
00:22:05,240 --> 00:22:07,039
- Well...
- She really hit the jackpot.

389
00:22:07,040 --> 00:22:08,439
- Yeah.
- But why is it going up?

390
00:22:08,440 --> 00:22:09,800
I don't blame Xiao Zhen.

391
00:22:10,280 --> 00:22:12,520
- Let me jump.
- Anyone would get love-crazed.

392
00:22:12,680 --> 00:22:13,680
Hold it higher.

393
00:22:14,360 --> 00:22:15,599
Are they playing basketball?

394
00:22:15,600 --> 00:22:16,639
Hold it higher.

395
00:22:16,640 --> 00:22:17,720
They're making googly eyes
at each other.

396
00:22:17,840 --> 00:22:18,840
Just like that.

397
00:22:18,841 --> 00:22:20,240
You have to admit,
it's pretty sweet.

398
00:22:20,360 --> 00:22:21,360
Let's go.

399
00:22:22,280 --> 00:22:23,280
Come on, aim.

400
00:22:23,800 --> 00:22:24,800
- What do you think?
- Careful.

401
00:22:24,801 --> 00:22:26,240
Don't you think
being in love is quite nice?

402
00:22:26,800 --> 00:22:27,800
Try it.

403
00:22:28,040 --> 00:22:29,679
I'm not a three-year-old.

404
00:22:29,680 --> 00:22:31,000
I don't want everything I see.

405
00:22:32,000 --> 00:22:33,719
All my energy right now...

406
00:22:33,720 --> 00:22:35,120
is focused on flying planes.

407
00:22:36,080 --> 00:22:38,000
Dating has nothing to do with me.

408
00:22:39,400 --> 00:22:40,800
Before, you didn't date...

409
00:22:41,040 --> 00:22:43,040
because you had to focus
on becoming a pilot.

410
00:22:43,800 --> 00:22:44,879
Now that you've made it,

411
00:22:44,880 --> 00:22:46,400
you say you need to focus on flying.

412
00:22:46,760 --> 00:22:47,999
Are you really planning to wait...

413
00:22:48,000 --> 00:22:49,240
until you retire
for a sunset romance?

414
00:22:49,640 --> 00:22:51,000
I just feel that...

415
00:22:51,280 --> 00:22:53,960
no one is indispensable
in this world.

416
00:22:54,520 --> 00:22:55,520
Even without a relationship,
life is still pretty good.

417
00:22:56,640 --> 00:22:58,640
I think your mindset
is quite dangerous.

418
00:22:59,400 --> 00:23:01,480
We should be prepared
to leave at any time,

419
00:23:01,880 --> 00:23:03,359
but you shouldn't reject someone...

420
00:23:03,360 --> 00:23:05,280
who comes to you
with a heart full of sincerity.

421
00:23:05,640 --> 00:23:07,200
Full of sincerity?

422
00:23:07,760 --> 00:23:08,840
Who? Yan An?

423
00:23:09,680 --> 00:23:10,680
Oh, give me a break.

424
00:23:11,440 --> 00:23:13,840
I'm not talking about him.

425
00:23:19,600 --> 00:23:20,680
Why did you come to Hengshi?

426
00:23:24,920 --> 00:23:25,920
Was it for me?

427
00:23:28,280 --> 00:23:29,480
- What's wrong?
- Let's practice some more.

428
00:23:30,680 --> 00:23:32,080
- What's going on?
- Nothing.

429
00:23:33,240 --> 00:23:35,560
I think I've just been dazed
by the fireworks.

430
00:23:38,040 --> 00:23:39,839
Hey, you two beauties.

431
00:23:39,840 --> 00:23:41,159
It's boring just sitting here.

432
00:23:41,160 --> 00:23:42,160
Come and play!

433
00:23:42,360 --> 00:23:43,360
- No, thanks.
- We're good.

434
00:23:44,760 --> 00:23:46,599
It's also my first time seeing
a "lift-style" basketball shot.

435
00:23:46,600 --> 00:23:47,600
Very creative.

436
00:23:47,601 --> 00:23:48,760
Being sarcastic, are you?

437
00:23:49,200 --> 00:23:50,960
It's fine. I'm not mad.

438
00:23:51,400 --> 00:23:52,400
At least it proves...

439
00:23:52,480 --> 00:23:54,240
he's not what you two
thought he would be.

440
00:23:54,680 --> 00:23:56,200
Do you need us to step away?

441
00:23:56,600 --> 00:23:59,759
Give you two some private space?

442
00:23:59,760 --> 00:24:01,039
Does it even matter...

443
00:24:01,040 --> 00:24:02,680
if we step away now?

444
00:24:03,560 --> 00:24:04,560
You two!

445
00:24:05,000 --> 00:24:07,080
It's only the second time we've met.

446
00:24:08,040 --> 00:24:09,840
Only the second time?

447
00:24:10,560 --> 00:24:11,560
Then what was that just now?

448
00:24:11,600 --> 00:24:12,960
- A boost.
- A boost.

449
00:24:13,400 --> 00:24:14,400
Well...

450
00:24:14,600 --> 00:24:16,120
We're just friends for now.

451
00:24:16,800 --> 00:24:18,800
I wonder what he's really thinking.

452
00:24:19,120 --> 00:24:20,280
Don't worry.

453
00:24:20,440 --> 00:24:21,880
At least it's not unrequited love.

454
00:24:22,680 --> 00:24:23,680
Really?

455
00:24:23,960 --> 00:24:24,960
Really?

456
00:24:25,960 --> 00:24:26,960
Then I'm going to confess.

457
00:24:28,320 --> 00:24:29,479
Confess what?

458
00:24:29,480 --> 00:24:31,080
You need to stay calm.

459
00:24:31,480 --> 00:24:32,679
If he's interested in you,

460
00:24:32,680 --> 00:24:33,760
he'll be the one to confess.

461
00:24:34,000 --> 00:24:36,199
But Ruan Ruan just said...

462
00:24:36,200 --> 00:24:37,600
it's not one-sided.

463
00:24:37,920 --> 00:24:39,919
He must be interested in me.

464
00:24:39,920 --> 00:24:42,000
Even if he is,
he's keeping his cool.

465
00:24:42,480 --> 00:24:44,159
My advice is...

466
00:24:44,160 --> 00:24:45,160
to wait a bit longer.

467
00:24:45,760 --> 00:24:47,480
Good things come to those who wait.

468
00:24:48,840 --> 00:24:49,880
All right then.

469
00:24:51,840 --> 00:24:52,840
I'll head back over there.

470
00:24:53,440 --> 00:24:54,480
Lu Ming said...

471
00:24:54,680 --> 00:24:55,760
he'll treat us
to a late-night snack.

472
00:24:56,160 --> 00:24:57,360
Good things come to those who wait.

473
00:24:58,280 --> 00:24:59,280
I'll pass.

474
00:25:00,120 --> 00:25:01,960
I have to get up early.
I have a flight tomorrow.

475
00:25:03,840 --> 00:25:05,080
There will be
plenty of chances later.

476
00:25:06,360 --> 00:25:07,360
Xuan,

477
00:25:07,600 --> 00:25:09,640
I'll leave the "child"
in your hands.

478
00:25:10,320 --> 00:25:11,320
Bye.

479
00:25:15,640 --> 00:25:17,439
Then I'm going.

480
00:25:17,440 --> 00:25:18,560
Go ahead.

481
00:25:21,520 --> 00:25:22,720
You're back.

482
00:25:22,840 --> 00:25:24,319
Here. You must be thirsty.

483
00:25:24,320 --> 00:25:25,320
Take this.

484
00:25:25,560 --> 00:25:26,840
Leave the "child" to me.

485
00:25:26,920 --> 00:25:27,920
You're such a handful.

486
00:25:36,840 --> 00:25:37,920
Coming back so late.

487
00:25:42,680 --> 00:25:43,720
Have you been drinking?

488
00:25:56,520 --> 00:25:57,520
You didn't fly today, did you?

489
00:26:07,240 --> 00:26:08,240
Aren't you getting off?

490
00:26:09,520 --> 00:26:10,520
Oh no.

491
00:26:11,040 --> 00:26:12,040
I've completely lost it.

492
00:26:13,320 --> 00:26:15,240
Why is he everywhere?

493
00:26:35,760 --> 00:26:36,760
It's warm.

494
00:26:38,880 --> 00:26:39,880
Are you...

495
00:26:41,480 --> 00:26:42,480
Fu Ming Yu?

496
00:26:43,160 --> 00:26:44,160
Who else?

497
00:26:44,400 --> 00:26:45,480
Do you think I'm Jay Chou?

498
00:26:46,160 --> 00:26:48,040
If your mental state is unstable,

499
00:26:48,640 --> 00:26:50,200
I suggest you seek treatment.

500
00:26:50,480 --> 00:26:51,480
Why are you here?

501
00:26:51,800 --> 00:26:52,800
I'm coming home from work.

502
00:26:53,080 --> 00:26:54,080
Shouldn't I be here?

503
00:26:54,240 --> 00:26:55,240
As for you,

504
00:26:55,560 --> 00:26:56,920
you didn't get off
at the basement level.

505
00:26:58,400 --> 00:26:59,480
Why are you here?

506
00:27:04,960 --> 00:27:05,960
Mr. Fu?

507
00:27:07,320 --> 00:27:08,320
Are you on the phone?

508
00:27:08,440 --> 00:27:09,440
I'll come back later then.

509
00:27:12,800 --> 00:27:13,800
I...

510
00:27:13,840 --> 00:27:15,159
I just remembered.

511
00:27:15,160 --> 00:27:16,879
The other night,
you came to my place.

512
00:27:16,880 --> 00:27:17,920
Was there something you wanted?

513
00:27:27,200 --> 00:27:28,679
Yan An. It's about Yan An.

514
00:27:28,680 --> 00:27:30,200
He said he was going
to set off fireworks,

515
00:27:30,360 --> 00:27:32,039
so I thought I would come
and let you know.

516
00:27:32,040 --> 00:27:33,080
Don't be fooled by him.

517
00:27:33,520 --> 00:27:34,960
When he pursues women,
it's always the same routine.

518
00:27:35,480 --> 00:27:36,640
Then what's your routine?

519
00:27:41,560 --> 00:27:42,560
What?

520
00:27:45,360 --> 00:27:46,360
Do you want to experience it?

521
00:27:50,360 --> 00:27:51,480
I... I'm home.

522
00:27:51,600 --> 00:27:52,600
I'll be going now.

523
00:27:52,880 --> 00:27:53,880
Wait.

524
00:27:55,440 --> 00:27:56,440
What?

525
00:27:57,040 --> 00:27:58,080
This is the 29th floor.

526
00:27:59,000 --> 00:28:00,000
I should be the one getting off.

527
00:28:13,680 --> 00:28:17,320
(Jiangcheng International Airport)

528
00:28:31,320 --> 00:28:33,320
So how does it feel
to fly solo for the first time?

529
00:28:35,000 --> 00:28:36,000
It's very exciting.

530
00:28:36,040 --> 00:28:37,040
But...

531
00:28:37,400 --> 00:28:38,800
I'm a little nervous.

532
00:28:39,080 --> 00:28:40,960
It's okay. Contact me anytime
if there's a problem.

533
00:28:46,840 --> 00:28:48,000
Mom.

534
00:28:49,320 --> 00:28:50,320
It's the busiest time
at the company.

535
00:28:50,400 --> 00:28:51,400
You're taking leave now?

536
00:28:52,560 --> 00:28:54,560
I... I'm taking leave,
but I'm not neglecting my work.

537
00:28:54,960 --> 00:28:56,839
Besides, I've been working
on this proposal day and night...

538
00:28:56,840 --> 00:28:57,840
for several nights now.

539
00:28:58,280 --> 00:28:59,960
I'm taking annual leave
to take my child home.

540
00:29:00,400 --> 00:29:04,519
Flight HS2076
from Jiangcheng to Shencheng...

541
00:29:04,520 --> 00:29:05,920
is now ready for boarding.

542
00:29:06,160 --> 00:29:07,479
Please have
your boarding passes ready.

543
00:29:07,480 --> 00:29:08,480
I'm about to board.

544
00:29:08,600 --> 00:29:09,679
I'll land in 2.5 hours
at the latest.

545
00:29:09,680 --> 00:29:11,000
I'll send it to you
as soon as I land, okay?

546
00:29:11,400 --> 00:29:12,400
Okay.

547
00:29:18,080 --> 00:29:19,560
Come here. Let Mommy hold you.

548
00:29:20,240 --> 00:29:21,680
Let's go. We're ready to board.

549
00:29:31,640 --> 00:29:32,640
Hold onto the tickets.

550
00:29:38,760 --> 00:29:40,959
It's okay. Don't cry.

551
00:29:40,960 --> 00:29:42,960
- Mommy.
- Okay, we're almost there, okay?

552
00:29:43,160 --> 00:29:44,399
Mommy.

553
00:29:44,400 --> 00:29:45,959
- Hello, ma'am.
- Mommy.

554
00:29:45,960 --> 00:29:47,479
Okay, stop crying. There, there.

555
00:29:47,480 --> 00:29:48,679
- Don't cry.
- Ma'am.

556
00:29:48,680 --> 00:29:50,160
- Thank you.
- You're welcome. Hello.

557
00:29:50,560 --> 00:29:51,600
It's further back.

558
00:29:52,240 --> 00:29:53,439
Hello.

559
00:29:53,440 --> 00:29:54,520
Okay, thank you.

560
00:29:55,280 --> 00:29:56,440
- Let me help you with that.
- Watch your step.

561
00:29:56,840 --> 00:29:58,039
- Be careful.
- Okay.

562
00:29:58,040 --> 00:29:59,199
- Welcome aboard, little one.
- Hello.

563
00:29:59,200 --> 00:30:00,200
Where is your seat?

564
00:30:00,680 --> 00:30:01,680
This one right here.

565
00:30:01,681 --> 00:30:03,000
Here. Let me help you.

566
00:30:04,840 --> 00:30:05,840
Welcome aboard.

567
00:30:07,240 --> 00:30:08,440
Hello, welcome aboard.

568
00:30:10,680 --> 00:30:11,680
Welcome aboard.

569
00:30:14,120 --> 00:30:15,120
Thank you.

570
00:30:16,360 --> 00:30:17,560
This is the infant seatbelt.

571
00:30:17,720 --> 00:30:18,720
Please fasten it before takeoff.

572
00:30:18,800 --> 00:30:19,800
Okay.

573
00:30:26,200 --> 00:30:28,719
Ladies and gentlemen,

574
00:30:28,720 --> 00:30:30,519
thank you for your patience.

575
00:30:30,520 --> 00:30:32,560
This flight is
about to taxi for takeoff.

576
00:30:33,120 --> 00:30:35,079
- To ensure your safety...
- Mom!

577
00:30:35,080 --> 00:30:36,559
please stow your tray tables,

578
00:30:36,560 --> 00:30:37,879
return your seat backs
to the upright position,

579
00:30:37,880 --> 00:30:38,880
and open your window shades.

580
00:30:38,881 --> 00:30:41,000
What a troublesome kid.
Can't they quiet down?

581
00:30:41,640 --> 00:30:42,640
I really don't understand.

582
00:30:43,160 --> 00:30:45,319
Why must she bring a child along
when traveling?

583
00:30:45,320 --> 00:30:46,320
Duo Duo, don't cry. Be good.

584
00:30:46,321 --> 00:30:47,599
- Be good, okay? Stop crying.
- Please turn off all electronics.

585
00:30:47,600 --> 00:30:49,000
Or switch them to airplane mode.

586
00:30:50,600 --> 00:30:52,199
Hello, ma'am,
during takeoff and landing,

587
00:30:52,200 --> 00:30:53,599
the child might feel pressure
in her ears.

588
00:30:53,600 --> 00:30:55,000
I suggest you give her some water.

589
00:30:55,080 --> 00:30:56,080
It will help relieve the symptoms.

590
00:30:56,480 --> 00:30:58,560
Okay. Here, drink some water.

591
00:30:59,200 --> 00:31:01,280
Good girl. Drink some water
and stop crying.

592
00:31:02,560 --> 00:31:03,560
- Swallow it.
- Thank you.

593
00:31:03,840 --> 00:31:05,840
Ma'am, for large devices
like this...

594
00:31:05,960 --> 00:31:06,960
I just need a minute.

595
00:31:07,040 --> 00:31:08,400
Wait, just give me one minute.

596
00:31:08,600 --> 00:31:10,279
Ma'am, we are on a tight schedule.

597
00:31:10,280 --> 00:31:11,919
Using it like this is unsafe.

598
00:31:11,920 --> 00:31:12,920
Here, let me help you.

599
00:31:12,921 --> 00:31:14,119
No, here.

600
00:31:14,120 --> 00:31:15,560
- You can handle that part.
- Okay.

601
00:31:16,600 --> 00:31:18,360
Excuse me, ma'am.
We really need to hurry.

602
00:31:18,760 --> 00:31:19,760
Okay.

603
00:31:19,800 --> 00:31:20,800
Let me help you.

604
00:31:21,440 --> 00:31:22,440
Fasten your seatbelt.

605
00:31:22,441 --> 00:31:23,959
- Thank you.
- Give her more water.

606
00:31:23,960 --> 00:31:26,480
If you need anything,
just press the button above you.

607
00:31:26,520 --> 00:31:27,520
- Okay.
- Thank you.

608
00:32:01,680 --> 00:32:02,960
I'm sorry, my computer...

609
00:32:03,640 --> 00:32:04,839
Your kid is so noisy.

610
00:32:04,840 --> 00:32:06,039
Can you do something about it?

611
00:32:06,040 --> 00:32:07,040
I'm sorry.

612
00:32:08,240 --> 00:32:10,239
It's so annoying.
Can't you let people sleep?

613
00:32:10,240 --> 00:32:11,719
I caught an early flight
just to catch up on some sleep.

614
00:32:11,720 --> 00:32:13,479
- Exactly.
- Good heavens.

615
00:32:13,480 --> 00:32:15,719
That kid's voice is
higher than my blood pressure!

616
00:32:15,720 --> 00:32:16,759
I know, right? My goodness.

617
00:32:16,760 --> 00:32:17,879
I'm sorry.

618
00:32:17,880 --> 00:32:19,039
I'm really sorry.

619
00:32:19,040 --> 00:32:20,359
Her ears hurt from the flight.

620
00:32:20,360 --> 00:32:21,360
She'll be fine
once she falls asleep.

621
00:32:21,520 --> 00:32:22,520
Go to sleep, Duo Duo.

622
00:32:23,320 --> 00:32:24,519
- Be good.
- You'll get it when you have kids.

623
00:32:24,520 --> 00:32:26,240
Duo Duo, be good and go to sleep.

624
00:32:30,120 --> 00:32:31,120
Ms. Jiang.

625
00:32:31,560 --> 00:32:33,280
That kid in the back is really loud.

626
00:32:33,720 --> 00:32:34,920
It's like Nezha reincarnated.

627
00:32:35,040 --> 00:32:36,040
When she starts crying,

628
00:32:36,041 --> 00:32:37,520
even the front cabin passengers
get annoyed.

629
00:32:37,760 --> 00:32:38,760
What about the back cabin?

630
00:32:38,920 --> 00:32:40,280
It's total chaos back there.

631
00:32:40,560 --> 00:32:41,720
The call bells haven't
stopped ringing.

632
00:32:42,000 --> 00:32:43,000
Ding-dong, ding-dong.

633
00:32:43,200 --> 00:32:44,360
Is it worse than the summer rush?

634
00:32:44,680 --> 00:32:45,680
Ms. Jiang,

635
00:32:45,800 --> 00:32:47,320
it's just as bad as the summer rush.

636
00:32:49,560 --> 00:32:50,560
Xiao Ruan,

637
00:32:50,680 --> 00:32:52,519
after you pass
your upgrade exam next week,

638
00:32:52,520 --> 00:32:53,640
you'll be able to fly
in the left seat.

639
00:32:54,320 --> 00:32:56,120
I'll talk to the planning desk...

640
00:32:56,320 --> 00:32:57,320
in advance.

641
00:32:57,400 --> 00:32:58,400
I'll be the one to take you
on your first flight.

642
00:32:58,560 --> 00:32:59,560
Thank you, Captain.

643
00:33:00,280 --> 00:33:01,280
After we finish today's flight,

644
00:33:01,360 --> 00:33:02,360
let's take a photo as a memento.

645
00:33:02,560 --> 00:33:03,919
I don't know when I'll get to fly...

646
00:33:03,920 --> 00:33:06,960
with our company's
only two female captains again.

647
00:33:07,600 --> 00:33:08,600
No problem.

648
00:33:08,720 --> 00:33:09,720
Captain Fan, Yang Ming,
I'm going to the lavatory.

649
00:33:11,320 --> 00:33:12,320
Go ahead.

650
00:33:16,760 --> 00:33:18,759
Please cover. Ruan Si Xian is
going to the lavatory.

651
00:33:18,760 --> 00:33:19,760
Okay, got it.

652
00:33:20,200 --> 00:33:21,720
You go ahead.
I'll check it out in a bit.

653
00:33:39,640 --> 00:33:40,640
Be good.

654
00:33:43,880 --> 00:33:45,440
Duo Duo, sit here
by yourself for a while.

655
00:33:46,360 --> 00:33:47,560
Mommy's going to the restroom.

656
00:34:03,040 --> 00:34:05,040
Hello, ma'am. Can I help you?

657
00:34:05,200 --> 00:34:06,999
I'm not feeling well.
I need to use the restroom.

658
00:34:07,000 --> 00:34:09,239
Sorry, ma'am.
The lavatory is currently occupied.

659
00:34:09,240 --> 00:34:10,240
Please wait a moment.

660
00:34:10,320 --> 00:34:11,320
Where do you feel unwell?

661
00:34:11,960 --> 00:34:12,960
I feel a bit nauseous.

662
00:34:13,760 --> 00:34:14,760
Ma'am?

663
00:34:15,960 --> 00:34:16,960
Ma'am?

664
00:34:17,000 --> 00:34:18,359
- Ma'am!
- What's happening?

665
00:34:18,360 --> 00:34:19,360
Are you okay?

666
00:34:22,440 --> 00:34:23,440
Ma'am?

667
00:34:23,600 --> 00:34:24,759
- Ma'am?
- What's the situation?

668
00:34:24,760 --> 00:34:26,360
Ms. Jiang, this lady fainted.

669
00:34:26,680 --> 00:34:28,159
Move her to the forward cabin.
Prepare for first aid.

670
00:34:28,160 --> 00:34:29,280
Okay.

671
00:34:29,680 --> 00:34:30,959
- Sorry about this.
- It's okay.

672
00:34:30,960 --> 00:34:32,000
- Sorry.
- It's okay.

673
00:34:33,600 --> 00:34:34,600
What's the situation back there?

674
00:34:35,120 --> 00:34:36,359
A passenger suddenly fainted.

675
00:34:36,360 --> 00:34:37,360
She's clutching her chest.

676
00:34:37,361 --> 00:34:38,400
It looks like a heart problem.

677
00:34:41,560 --> 00:34:42,800
Ladies and gentlemen,

678
00:34:43,280 --> 00:34:45,280
we have a passenger on board
who is feeling unwell.

679
00:34:45,400 --> 00:34:47,400
If you are a doctor
or medical personnel,

680
00:34:47,560 --> 00:34:49,560
please see a flight attendant
immediately.

681
00:34:49,680 --> 00:34:50,680
Thank you.

682
00:34:52,280 --> 00:34:54,439
Hello, ma'am. Could you please
let this lady through?

683
00:34:54,440 --> 00:34:55,919
Thank you.

684
00:34:55,920 --> 00:34:57,560
- Sorry for the trouble. Thank you.
- Mommy!

685
00:35:01,720 --> 00:35:03,840
- Don't cry.
- I want my mommy.

686
00:35:05,400 --> 00:35:06,400
Are you a doctor?

687
00:35:06,440 --> 00:35:07,480
- Yes.
- Hurry.

688
00:35:20,080 --> 00:35:21,160
Do you want to find your mommy?

689
00:35:22,520 --> 00:35:23,520
It's okay, don't cry.

690
00:35:24,480 --> 00:35:26,240
Hello. What's happening up there?

691
00:35:26,520 --> 00:35:27,920
It's all right, ma'am.
Please don't panic.

692
00:35:36,120 --> 00:35:37,120
It looks like a sudden heart attack.

693
00:35:37,160 --> 00:35:38,160
She needs medical attention
immediately.

694
00:35:38,480 --> 00:35:40,120
I'm performing CPR on her now.

695
00:35:40,280 --> 00:35:41,280
I need your assistance.

696
00:35:47,560 --> 00:35:49,399
Captain Fan,
the medical professional on board...

697
00:35:49,400 --> 00:35:50,400
says it's a sudden heart attack.

698
00:35:50,760 --> 00:35:51,800
The patient needs
immediate hospitalization.

699
00:35:52,320 --> 00:35:53,320
Okay, understood.

700
00:35:55,200 --> 00:35:57,400
In this situation, we definitely
can't continue the flight.

701
00:35:58,080 --> 00:35:59,560
Returning to Jiangcheng for landing.

702
00:35:59,880 --> 00:36:01,200
Weather meets landing standards.

703
00:36:01,360 --> 00:36:03,360
Fuel is sufficient.
Consider an overweight landing.

704
00:36:03,560 --> 00:36:05,560
At our main operations base,
we'll have full support.

705
00:36:05,600 --> 00:36:07,040
Xiao Ruan, calculate
the landing performance.

706
00:36:07,240 --> 00:36:09,240
- Copy.
- Jiangcheng, Hengshi 2076.

707
00:36:09,600 --> 00:36:10,600
Hengshi 2076, go ahead.

708
00:36:11,120 --> 00:36:12,559
A passenger has fainted on board.

709
00:36:12,560 --> 00:36:14,759
Medical personnel on board
are currently treating her.

710
00:36:14,760 --> 00:36:15,880
She needs emergency medical care.

711
00:36:16,200 --> 00:36:18,200
Requesting to return to base.
Requesting radar vectors.

712
00:36:18,240 --> 00:36:19,920
Help me contact dispatch
and relevant departments.

713
00:36:20,360 --> 00:36:21,600
Hengshi 2076, roger.

714
00:36:21,920 --> 00:36:23,799
Radar vectors.
Turn right heading 210.

715
00:36:23,800 --> 00:36:24,839
Descend to 42.

716
00:36:24,840 --> 00:36:26,679
Turn right heading 210.
Descend to 42.

717
00:36:26,680 --> 00:36:27,999
Hengshi 2076.

718
00:36:28,000 --> 00:36:29,000
Descend to 42.
Confirm.

719
00:36:31,560 --> 00:36:32,719
Alt 42, 138 set.

720
00:36:32,720 --> 00:36:33,720
Confirm.

721
00:36:33,721 --> 00:36:35,799
Thrust idle, open descent, alt blue.

722
00:36:35,800 --> 00:36:36,960
Alt 42, 138 blue.

723
00:36:37,840 --> 00:36:38,840
Check.

724
00:36:38,841 --> 00:36:39,880
Turn right heading 210.

725
00:36:40,160 --> 00:36:41,160
Confirm.

726
00:36:41,360 --> 00:36:42,400
Heading 210 blue.

727
00:36:42,800 --> 00:36:43,800
Check.

728
00:36:47,800 --> 00:36:49,080
Ladies and gentlemen,

729
00:36:49,520 --> 00:36:50,760
this is your purser speaking.

730
00:36:51,200 --> 00:36:52,359
Due to a passenger on board...

731
00:36:52,360 --> 00:36:53,360
requiring emergency
medical attention,

732
00:36:53,720 --> 00:36:55,240
the captain has decided
to return immediately.

733
00:36:55,680 --> 00:36:57,040
We apologize
for the inconvenience...

734
00:36:57,160 --> 00:36:58,160
this may cause to your journey.

735
00:36:58,560 --> 00:37:00,479
Thank you for your understanding.
Thank you.

736
00:37:00,480 --> 00:37:01,680
I'm worried.

737
00:37:02,280 --> 00:37:03,880
Your mom will be here soon.

738
00:37:05,320 --> 00:37:06,320
Mommy!

739
00:37:40,840 --> 00:37:42,639
How much longer until we land?
The patient can't wait much longer.

740
00:37:42,640 --> 00:37:43,640
I'll go ask.

741
00:37:47,880 --> 00:37:49,919
Captain, the doctor says the patient
is in critical condition.

742
00:37:49,920 --> 00:37:50,920
We need to land as soon as possible.

743
00:37:51,040 --> 00:37:52,320
How much longer until we arrive?

744
00:37:52,760 --> 00:37:54,320
As it stands now,
it'll take more than 20 minutes.

745
00:37:57,080 --> 00:37:58,080
Hengshi 2076,

746
00:37:58,081 --> 00:37:59,320
contact Approach on 125.55.

747
00:38:00,000 --> 00:38:02,080
125.55, Hengshi 2076.

748
00:38:04,680 --> 00:38:06,200
The more urgent it is,
the calmer we must be.

749
00:38:07,200 --> 00:38:08,200
While we race against time...

750
00:38:08,201 --> 00:38:09,280
for the passenger
in critical condition,

751
00:38:09,600 --> 00:38:12,040
we are also responsible.
for the safety...

752
00:38:12,800 --> 00:38:14,040
of the other 181 passengers
on board.

753
00:38:14,840 --> 00:38:15,840
Prepare for approach.

754
00:38:15,880 --> 00:38:16,880
Roger.

755
00:38:21,920 --> 00:38:23,080
Have you contacted
the patient's family?

756
00:38:23,280 --> 00:38:24,840
Yes, we have.
But none of them are local.

757
00:38:26,000 --> 00:38:27,000
What's the current situation?

758
00:38:27,160 --> 00:38:28,680
The crew is
doing their best to return.

759
00:38:28,840 --> 00:38:30,400
There's a doctor on board
who is performing CPR.

760
00:38:30,920 --> 00:38:32,040
There's no time to burn fuel.

761
00:38:32,160 --> 00:38:33,720
We're looking
at an overweight landing.

762
00:38:34,760 --> 00:38:36,320
The ambulance is already
standing by near the runway.

763
00:38:36,760 --> 00:38:37,760
Who's the captain?

764
00:38:38,000 --> 00:38:39,200
Fan Lei, Yu Yang Ming,

765
00:38:41,200 --> 00:38:42,200
and Ruan Si Xian.

766
00:38:45,480 --> 00:38:46,520
I'm on my way there.

767
00:38:47,240 --> 00:38:48,240
Listen.

768
00:38:48,360 --> 00:38:49,960
Hengshi's safety record...

769
00:38:50,520 --> 00:38:51,520
must be maintained.

770
00:38:51,680 --> 00:38:52,680
Understood.

771
00:38:54,600 --> 00:38:55,600
Hello, Captain.

772
00:38:55,760 --> 00:38:56,760
The patient's condition
has worsened.
She needs
immediate medical attention.

773
00:38:58,040 --> 00:38:59,960
If we delay any longer,
her life could be in danger.

774
00:39:23,120 --> 00:39:24,120
Okay, I understand.

775
00:39:24,200 --> 00:39:25,200
Stop the calls.

776
00:39:25,201 --> 00:39:26,600
- We land in 10 minutes.
- Roger.

777
00:39:29,840 --> 00:39:31,160
Disconnecting autopilot.
I'll take manual control.

778
00:39:32,200 --> 00:39:33,200
The timing should be about right.

779
00:39:33,640 --> 00:39:35,559
Should we disconnect it?
There's no need to disconnect.

780
00:39:35,560 --> 00:39:36,720
With autopilot engaged,

781
00:39:37,040 --> 00:39:38,120
the bank angle is limited
to 30 degrees.

782
00:39:38,600 --> 00:39:39,880
I'm disconnecting
for manual control.

783
00:39:40,080 --> 00:39:41,400
- We'll bank up to 45 degrees.
- Negative.

784
00:39:41,800 --> 00:39:43,479
Exceeding 30 degrees
will trigger the QAR.

785
00:39:43,480 --> 00:39:45,559
Three turns like this
will save at least 15 minutes.

786
00:39:45,560 --> 00:39:46,640
There's no time. Listen to me.

787
00:39:46,960 --> 00:39:47,960
Captain Fan.

788
00:39:47,961 --> 00:39:49,160
Contact the tower
to prepare for landing.

789
00:39:49,880 --> 00:39:51,200
I'll take full responsibility.

790
00:39:51,440 --> 00:39:52,560
Approach checklist.

791
00:39:52,640 --> 00:39:53,680
Overweight landing checklist.

792
00:39:59,720 --> 00:40:00,720
CAT 3 Single.

793
00:40:01,880 --> 00:40:03,080
- CAT 1.
- Check.

794
00:40:38,760 --> 00:40:39,760
Requesting right turn.

795
00:40:40,040 --> 00:40:42,640
Tower, Hengshi 2076
requesting right turn.

796
00:40:42,920 --> 00:40:44,599
Hengshi 2076.
Right turn at your discretion.

797
00:40:44,600 --> 00:40:46,359
Establish ILS Runway 04.
Report established.

798
00:40:46,360 --> 00:40:48,039
Right turn at our discretion.
ILS Runway 04.

799
00:40:48,040 --> 00:40:49,440
Report established. Hengshi 2076.

800
00:40:49,760 --> 00:40:50,920
Prepare for approach.

801
00:41:11,240 --> 00:41:13,240
Why is the plane turning?

802
00:41:14,320 --> 00:41:15,320
Full flaps.

803
00:41:15,321 --> 00:41:17,039
Speed checked. Full flaps.

804
00:41:17,040 --> 00:41:18,040
Landing checklist.

805
00:41:26,360 --> 00:41:27,360
Landing.

806
00:41:27,400 --> 00:41:28,400
Check.

807
00:41:28,640 --> 00:41:30,160
- One hundred above.
- Check.

808
00:41:30,560 --> 00:41:31,920
- Minimums.
- Continue.

809
00:41:40,120 --> 00:41:41,120
Fifty.

810
00:41:41,160 --> 00:41:42,160
Forty.

811
00:41:42,320 --> 00:41:43,320
Thirty.

812
00:41:43,440 --> 00:41:44,440
Twenty.

813
00:41:46,400 --> 00:41:47,400
Spoilers.

814
00:41:48,880 --> 00:41:49,880
Reversers green.

815
00:41:50,120 --> 00:41:51,120
Decel.

816
00:43:14,040 --> 00:43:15,719
Don't worry, the passenger
with the heart attack...

817
00:43:15,720 --> 00:43:16,760
was resuscitated.

818
00:43:17,240 --> 00:43:18,720
And her family
has already arrived at the hospital.

819
00:43:19,120 --> 00:43:20,800
They said they want to give our crew
a silk banner of gratitude.

820
00:43:21,560 --> 00:43:22,560
I see.

821
00:43:23,240 --> 00:43:25,040
What about the Safety Committee?

822
00:43:25,520 --> 00:43:26,520
Let's wait.

823
00:43:27,080 --> 00:43:28,080
Let's see
the captain's report first.

824
00:43:29,160 --> 00:43:30,160
Okay.

825
00:43:30,280 --> 00:43:31,280
Let me give you an update.

826
00:43:32,520 --> 00:43:34,680
The flight has resumed operations.

827
00:43:35,080 --> 00:43:37,079
But it will be delayed
by two hours...

828
00:43:37,080 --> 00:43:38,080
reaching its destination.

829
00:43:40,720 --> 00:43:42,480
Then tonight,
treat the whole crew to dinner.

830
00:43:42,800 --> 00:43:43,800
In my personal name.

831
00:43:44,160 --> 00:43:45,200
Okay, I'll arrange it.

832
00:43:47,400 --> 00:43:52,480
(Departing Ep. 7 for Ep. 8)
